  ('Intensive English Training', 'Reading Comprehension', 'An author''s purpose to ''inform'' means the text mainly:', '["Tells a fictional story","Tries to sell a product","Expresses personal feelings only","Provides facts and information on a topic"]'::jsonb, 3),
