  ('Intensive English Training', 'Writing Practice', 'In formal writing, contractions like ''don''t'' or ''can''t'' should generally be:', '["Written in capital letters","Used as often as possible","Replaced with slang","Avoided in favor of full forms like ''do not'' or ''cannot''"]'::jsonb, 3),
